    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "hmm it would be 最長（さいちょう）instead of 最低（さいてい）. 最長⇔最短（さいたん）、最高（さいこう）⇔最低",
      "html": "hmm it would be 最長（さいちょう）instead of 最低（さいてい）. 最長⇔最短（さいたん）、最高（さいこう）⇔最低",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "51bba70e9dfec23368a6df48ba1dbf0e8ceab0027deacbcba81476b46e62c0b3",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "You guys must mean 最悪の場合. You would not say さいていの場合、三日掛かる but could say さいてい三日掛かる, which would mean \"takes the minimum of three days.\"The former says that it could be done in less than three days, but the latter would say it takes three days or more.",
      "html": "You guys must mean 最悪の場合. You would not say さいていの場合、三日掛かる but could say さいてい三日掛かる, which would mean \"takes the minimum of three days.\"The former says that it could be done in less than three days, but the latter would say it takes three days or more.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "4609647c3817c87cb03ec26fd91ee8f701759b31a04f68489483b9a6f4d4f5eb",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Note that せいぜい also has the meaning of \"at th emost.\" For example, せいぜい３日もあればできる would mean \"It can be done in about three days at the very outside,\" In this sense it has the meaning similar to たかだか.",
      "html": "Note that せいぜい also has the meaning of \"at th emost.\" For example, せいぜい３日もあればできる would mean \"It can be done in about three days at the very outside,\" In this sense it has the meaning similar to たかだか.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "6a3b7f63a525f88888f7b363d6ec9e8a6f03fdd678c40ce9b3957d256c04653a",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "'At the very outside'? I don't understand this translation.",
      "html": "'At the very outside'? I don't understand this translation.",
      "credits_raw": "lupan",
      "content_sha256": "770e07407b58ee7fffb02240b1665caa56f16b1c3162ea8b7b03a3ca906d677e",
