      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "'At the very outside' means \"at the worst\". maybe literally, \"on the border of what might and might not happen\" \n-> さいていの場合、三日掛かる。",
      "html": "'At the very outside' means \"at the worst\". maybe literally, \"on the border of what might and might not happen\" <br/>-&gt; さいていの場合、三日掛かる。",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "1506a558a03317b2ef3928304dda6b714efcdfd7d37ba69e602c281677b503a8",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I thought \"最低\" also means \"the worst\". We would use it like \"in the worst case, we will miss the deadline by one day\". ie: you dont expect to, but...",
      "html": "I thought \"最低\" also means \"the worst\". We would use it like \"in the worst case, we will miss the deadline by one day\". ie: you dont expect to, but...",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "a401899b7f47d7f222785d7e33c4f1b07b0be69ab97771347bfdb3f6bee08949",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "最低 can be \"the worst\" but it also could mean \"minimum of\"",
      "html": "最低 can be \"the worst\" but it also could mean \"minimum of\"",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "d2c62191a38d55f2d7231c5fa99cd52a02c7e59c0f206fdbc6a4aa174a6949ea",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 8,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I don't think \"at the very outside\" is correct English. I guess you mean \"at most\".",
      "html": "I don't think \"at the very outside\" is correct English. I guess you mean \"at most\".",
      "credits_raw": "Gaijin demonai",
      "content_sha256": "b34445aecef0932b29336dad6c5b7af76f46f86b51f2481ceca325159ff100db",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 9,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I guess \"at the very outside\" is awkward, but I think \"at the outside\" should be acceptable.",
      "html": "I guess \"at the very outside\" is awkward, but I think \"at the outside\" should be acceptable.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "9431d991b9b7f9ebf3d8b508f0ab2de85416d4fc547b2b6fc2dc298bdd124bed",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 10,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "While I can't comment on any of the Japanese - \"at the outside\" is very informal in English. It refers to the expression \"an outside chance\" (a term from horseracing). So the first example would be better written: \"If it's this type of work, there is an outside chance that it can be done in about three days.\"",
      "html": "While I can't comment on any of the Japanese - \"at the outside\" is very informal in English. It refers to the expression \"an outside chance\" (a term from horseracing). So the first example would be better written: \"If it's this type of work, there is an outside chance that it can be done in about three days.\"",
      "credits_raw": "andyclap",
      "content_sha256": "a647608e1be41d7f8cbd08912ba54bca9c2b751e1542785aa0f162ce314825f7",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 11,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I have been told by a native speaker that \"せいぜい\" has a certain ironic or sarcastic tinge to it. It is used in the context of saying that someone \"did their best\", etc. in an ironic way, meaning it could have been done a bit better.",
      "html": "I have been told by a native speaker that \"せいぜい\" has a certain ironic or sarcastic tinge to it. It is used in the context of saying that someone \"did their best\", etc. in an ironic way, meaning it could have been done a bit better.",
      "credits_raw": "somakevin",
      "content_sha256": "61cd9e0bcf72c129b99833b5d1f2970286290fde2538cabf4a500a645af1f899",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 12,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "せいぜい三日もあれば出来る。−I can do it in atmost three days....... Correct me if I am wrong. Thanks",
